OL,3,GNEWSAIn the eye of a needle artist
OL,4,A'breaking boundaries'
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtist Adrian Thompson has created
OL,7,Fmicro art from small pieces of gold
OL,8,Fthat fit through the eye of a needle.
OL,10,FHe said he enjoyed challenging himself
OL,11,Fto see what he could create.
OL,13,FThompson, who works in Par, said: "As
OL,14,Fan artist sometimes it's you versus
OL,15,Fyourself. You want to see what you can
OL,16,Fcreate."
OL,18,FEach tiny piece takes up to a year to
OL,19,Fmake and he is planning to display it
OL,20,Fat Bodmin's Discovering 42 science
OL,21,Fmuseum in December.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
